================================================================================
Relationship to the SQIsign reference implementation
================================================================================

This project instruments and derives data from the SQIsign reference
implementation ("the-sqisign"):

    https://github.com/SQISign/the-sqisign
    commit dd133d7aca576c361a270c8e6434832535b42ecc
    License: Apache-2.0, (c) the SQIsign team.

The reference source code, its build artifacts, and the NIST Known-Answer-Test
(.rsp / .req) files are NOT redistributed in this repository.

What IS redistributed here, all original work under the MIT License:

  * harness/verify_trace.patch — a unified diff that APPLIES TO the reference
    file src/verification/ref/lvlx/verify.c (Apache-2.0). The diff is our work;
    the file it patches is not included. Applying the patch to your own checkout
    of the reference at the pinned commit reproduces the instrumented verifier.
  * harness/trace_main.c — a standalone driver, our work.
  * harness/build.sh — a build script, our work.
  * vectors/goldens-lvl{1,3,5}.json — intermediate j-invariants OBSERVED by
    running the instrumented reference over the NIST KAT inputs. These are facts
    about the reference's deterministic verification pipeline at the pinned
    commit; the KAT files themselves are not included.

If you redistribute the instrumented verifier that results from applying the
patch, that combined work is subject to the Apache-2.0 terms of the reference.

